<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="cs">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Moje Portfolio</title>
    <style>
        /* Moderní reset a font */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #0f0c29, #302b63, #24243e);
            background-size: 400% 400%;
            animation: gradientBG 15s ease infinite;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Animace pozadí */
        @keyframes gradientBG {
            0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
            50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
            100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
        }

        /* Skleněná karta */
        .glass-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 3rem;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.37);
            max-width: 500px;
            width: 90%;
            transform: translateY(0);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .glass-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
        }

        h1 {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #fff, #00d2ff);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        p {
            color: #e0e0e0;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        /* Malý detail - svítící tečka */
        .dot {
            height: 10px;
            width: 10px;
            background-color: #00d2ff;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-left: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px #00d2ff;
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0% { transform: scale(0.95); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.7); }
            70% { transform: scale(1); box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0); }
            100% { transform: scale(0.95); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(0, 210, 255, 0); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="glass-card">
        <h1>Tvoje Jméno<span class="dot"></span></h1>
        <p>Jsem kreativní nadšenec do technologií, který věří, že kód je moderní umění. Rád tvořím věci, které dávají smysl.</p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
